    "id": "Q001",
    "question": "I am on probation and want to join another company in the UAE. How much notice should I give?",
    "answer": "Under Federal Decree-Law No. 33 of 2021, Article 9(3), if you wish to move during the probationary period to work for another employer in the UAE, you must notify your original employer in writing **not less than one month** from the date of your wish to terminate the contract.\n\nSource: Federal Decree-Law No. 33 of 2021, Article 9 (Probationary Period), Clause 3.",
