    "id": "Q003",
    "question": "Can my employer put me on probation a second time with the same company?",
    "answer": "No. Under Federal Decree-Law No. 33 of 2021, Article 9(2), it is not permissible to appoint a worker under a probationary period more than once at the same employer. If the worker successfully passes the probationary period and continues to work, the contract becomes valid according to the agreed terms, and the probation period counts within the term of service.\n\nSource: Federal Decree-Law No. 33 of 2021, Article 9.",
